It was definitely a big stretch

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.543
for me as a songwriter.
It was really fun.

00:03:31.543 --> 00:03:33.145
-Well, February is gonna
be a giant month for you

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:35.415
because you have the Grammys,

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:37.149
you turn 21, by the way.
-Yeah.

00:03:37.149 --> 00:03:39.385
-Happy birthday.
Happy early birthday.

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.086
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:41.086 --> 00:03:42.555
-I'm very excited
